# Priberam s.v. "anteontem": "No dia que precedeu o dia de ontem. = ANTES DE
# ONTEM [...] Origem: ante- + ontem."  "anteontem" is the standard form, and
# Priberam gives "antes de ontem" as its synonym.  Priberam does not list
# "ante ontem".  It is a non-standard split spelling that speech-to-text
# writes, accepted here as input only.
anteontem
ante ontem
antes de ontem
